WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.615
Supply chain weaknesses can affect confidentiality, integrity, availability, safety, and trust.

2
00:00:06.615 --> 00:00:11.884
AI systems inherit traditional software risks and add AI-specific dependencies.

3
00:00:11.884 --> 00:00:14.488
A vulnerable package may expose systems.

4
00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:18.110
A poorly controlled model artifact may behave unpredictably.

5
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.872
A low-quality dataset may create unreliable outputs.

6
00:00:21.872 --> 00:00:25.105
A third-party API outage may disrupt service.

7
00:00:25.105 --> 00:00:33.895
A plugin with excessive permissions may create unnecessary exposure, especially when model output can trigger actions or access sensitive resources.

8
00:00:33.895 --> 00:00:42.496
AI supply chain risk matters because weaknesses in upstream components can affect downstream decisions, products, customers, and users.
